  "supersedes": "node-uri-io-0.1",
  "contract": "Canonical node addresses and source transfer. Explicit node URLs use a separate receiving transport context; implicit local spawn retains the client context. Address, visibility and ordinary-name isolation assertions are separate. Only an empty root path is canonicalized. Peer credentials and topology use the same key, with conflicting or duplicate canonical mappings refused; non-root paths remain distinct."
